        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Client Layer\n    subgraph Client Layer\n        R[React SPA]\n        REST_C[REST Client]\n        WS_C[WebSocket Client]\n        R --&gt; REST_C\n        R --&gt; WS_C\n    end\n\n    %% Application Layer (FastAPI)\n    subgraph FastAPI Application Layer\n        API[FastAPI Routers]\n        WSM[WebSocket Manager]\n        AE[Auction Engine / Business Logic]\n        TO[Task Orchestrator]\n        DAL[Data Access Layer / ORM]\n        \n        REST_C -- HTTP GET/POST --&gt; API\n        WS_C -- ws:// connection --&gt; WSM\n        \n        API --&gt; AE\n        AE --&gt; DAL\n        AE --&gt; TO\n        AE --&gt; WSM\n    end\n\n    %% Database Layer\n    subgraph Database Layer\n        DB[(PostgreSQL)]\n    end\n\n    %% Background Jobs\n    subgraph Async Workers\n        BW((APScheduler / Celery))\n    end\n\n    %% Connections\n    DAL -- \&quot;SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\&quot; --&gt; DB\n    TO -- Schedules/Cancels Tasks --&gt; BW\n    BW -- Updates RFQ Status to CLOSED --&gt; DB\n    BW -- Triggers Event --&gt; WSM&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="5jKbcGpFyEpzWAEmpXUg-1">
